    "commons_metadata": {
      "ImageDescription": {
        "value": "Built in 1963, this Modern Post Office was built to serve the city of Walton, Kentucky.  The building features a red brick exterior, a low-slope roof, an awning with exposed joists on the front facade, a storefront at the corner of the building’s lobby that features the main entrance door, a concrete base, a ribbon windows located high up the walls.  The building remains in use today as the Walton Post Office.",
        "source": "commons-desc-page"
